+ * Pseudo-TA: SDM Services
+ *
+ * Provides a secure enclave for accessing Intel SDM (Secure Device Manager)
+ * functions.	SDM operations are dispatched to ATF (EL3) via thread_smccc()
+ * and results are returned to the normal-world caller.
+ *
+ * Clients should call PTA_CMD_GET_VERSION first to validate the API version
+ * before invoking SDM-specific commands.
+ */
